Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:14.17,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs8\c&H44454E&\3c&HFAFEFE&\move(413,303.5,413,332,28,2447)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.26,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H7370A1&\3c&HF9FDF9&\pos(374.5,121)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:45.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Half a cabbage, potatoes, onions, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:48.55,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,carrots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:53.42,Default,MARKET VENDOR,0,0,0,,Ms. Maid! You having curry today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:55.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:56.59,Default,MARKET VENDOR,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:58.55,Default,MARKET VENDOR,0,0,0,,Here. One more on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:00.80,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:05.22,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:08.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:12.20,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,Um, I've been watching you \Nthis whole time, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:14.44,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,I was thinking how wonderful you are, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:17.45,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,I want to be just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:18.92,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm honored to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:23.53,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,And... Where can I buy those \Nclothes you're wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:25.46,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,These clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:26.87,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.83,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you when I got a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:33.79,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,They're the kind of clothes \Npeople don't normally wear, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:38.32,Default,MIKU,0,0,0,,I was thinking I could be \Njust like you if I wore them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:45.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.11,0:02:47.64,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:50.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:51.69,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was just at the bookstore, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:56.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is it not normal to wear a maid outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:31.95,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(273,1)\blur1\pos(230.5,264)}Episode {\c&H1C23D4&}7{\c&H000000&}: {\c&H1C23D4&}You{\c&H000000&}'ve Finally Figured It Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:31.95,DefaultItalicsTop,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And so, we made plans for next Sunday
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:34.83,DefaultItalicsTop,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,to go clothes shopping with Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:36.04,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs14\bord2\c&H504845&\3c&HF2F0EE&\pos(391,114)}Ogiso Station
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.34,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:41.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Over here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:43.51,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\c&HA8D5FC&\3c&H6244C0&\pos(85,36.5)}Lucky Day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Uh, were we expecting company?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:48.89,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,When I got your message, \NI just had to come, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:52.35,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord3\an7\c&H464744&\fs13\fax-0.1\frz346.4\3c&HE2E4DF&\pos(201.5,29)}You know Ms. Yuki's\Nrather limited wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:52.35,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord3\an7\c&H464744&\fs13\fax-0.15\frz346.4\3c&HE2E4DF&\pos(158,137.5)}I want to find out what else looks\Ngood on her, so I'm going to go\Nwith her to buy clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:56.31,DefaultItalics,RIKO {M},0,0,0,,I'm free on Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:59.01,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No, I understand why {\i1}you're{\i0} here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:00.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Why are {\i1}you{\i0} here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:05.24,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,When I overheard you talking, \NI just had to come, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That makes no sense, {\i1}and{\i0} it's creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:13.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My apologies. I thought I had disposed \Nof all the listening devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:17.85,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, too bad for you! \NThere's still one left in the living room!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:22.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Could you guys stop engaging in \Nhigh-tech espionage behind my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:26.49,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I don't trust you to pick out \Ngirls' clothes all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:29.89,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If you ask me, the trustworthiness \Nof this team has only gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:34.22,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Um... Excuse me, \Npretty and cool-looking lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.44,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Are you an assassin, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:39.40,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:40.50,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.47,0:05:43.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Please don't get involved with Riko, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:49.80,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow... A mature lady smells so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:52.98,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You're just like Hitoyoshi—\Namusing {\i1}and{\i0} adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:57.46,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Okay, well, leaving those two aside for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:06:00.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Let's pick out some clothes \Nfor you right away, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:01.88,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(148,1)\bord2\fnArial Black\an9\c&H72CAE6&\3c&H412AB0&\pos(623,24)}On Sale Now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.88,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh! About that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:04.85,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,There's a store I recommend nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:06.46,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,A Miss Riko recommendation...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:08.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, then let's try there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.09,0:06:08.82,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.84,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Are you ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:22.77,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:29.41,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,going to make her stand out \Neven more than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.41,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.41,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I couldn't resist...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:41.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Personally, this one seems more restricting \Nthan the last, which is a problem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:43.13,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's choosing based on efficiency...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:46.28,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But you look so, {\i1}so{\i0} good in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:47.92,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's so cute! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:48.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:52.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't forget! We're here to buy Ms. Yuki \N{\i1}normal{\i0} clothes that look nice on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:54.09,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:58.01,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Then it's my turn next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:00.85,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how to coordinate \Nan outfit like an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:08.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What do you think, Master Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:11.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,There'd be all kinds of problems \Nif you wore that around town!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:17.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It would be very hard \Nto hide my knives in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:20.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The knives are part of the criteria, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:24.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Putting that outfit aside, if you're not \Ngoing to assassinate anyone anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.40,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wow! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.55,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,do you really need to think about knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:32.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's not that. I just feel at ease having \Nthem with me, even if they're hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:35.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,You're not supposed to carry \Nhidden knives either, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:40.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey, you two. If you're not \Ngoing to take this seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,could you just leave us to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:47.15,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H22&\an7\bord0\blur0.4\p1\c&H58585A&\fscx17\fscy205\pos(394,10)}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:47.15,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H22&\an7\bord0\blur0.4\pos(411,10)\p1\c&HABE4D7&\fscx221\fscy205}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.14,0:07:47.15,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\c&H82975B&\pos(397,18)}7\N\N6\N\N5\N\N4\N\N{\c&H7770C4&}3\N\N\N\N{\c&H82975B&}2\N\N\N\N\N\N1\N\N\N\N\N\NB1\N\N\N\NB2
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.14,0:07:47.15,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\pos(414,18)\c&H82975B&}Rooftop\N\NTheater (Screen 4-8)\N\NTheater (Reception, Shop, Screen 1-3)\N\NRestaurant Town (Restaurant & Café, Event Hall)\N\N{\c&H7770C4&}Women's Fashion (Youth Fashion, Jeans,\NFormal Wear, Fur & Leather, Accessories)\N\N{\c&H82975B&}Men's Fashion (Suits & Jackets, Formal Wear,\NCasual Wear, Neckties, Dress Shirts,\NLeather, Bags)\N\NCosmetics, Fragrances, Misc. Goods\N(Lifestyle Misc. Goods, Makeup,\NSkin Care & Body Care, Aroma), Information Desk\N\NGroceries, Perishable Foods,\NSide Dishes & Bentos, Bread\N\NParking Lot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:44.72,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,My bad, my bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:47.15,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,L-Let's go to a normal store next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:06.66,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Yep... It's pissing me off \Nthat you look great in everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:07.92,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You're like a model...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:10.26,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What're you playing at, \Nsneaking that swimsuit in between?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:13.42,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,So, what kinda clothes \Ndo you prefer, Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:15.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What, me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:19.85,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I-I think something like... \Na white sundress...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:22.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,would look nice on her...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:27.29,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, indeed. Indeed, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:30.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Man, I am {\i1}so{\i0} done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:36.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,We finished making our choices, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:43.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's more like we dodged having to choose \Nby just buying everything you tried on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:45.21,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It was too difficult to decide between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:48.73,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Hey! They're having a Halloween fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:54.13,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I heard Halloween is one of the biggest events \Nin Japan, but this is really something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:57.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,This is awesome! There are so many costumes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:09:01.18,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,All right! Let's choose Big Brother's \Ncostume for this year right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:03.81,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What, we're really doing it again this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:07.52,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Of course! Mom looks forward \Nto it every year, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:10.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait, Riko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:14.13,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Trick or treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't you mean "treat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:22.08,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Servant was actually a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:25.61,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If you don't gimme candy, \Nyou're goin' straight in the slammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.18,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Man, this has nothing to do \Nwith Halloween anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:30.61,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo! Sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:35.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Miss Riko certainly looks \Nlike she's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:38.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,She gets kinda pumped up for it every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:43.60,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(362,1)\bord2.5\fnArial Black\an7\c&H2E58BA&\3c&H5E7DC6&\fs25}Horror Movie Festival!\N{\c&H5576B9&\3c&H274470&\fs20}BATTING DEAD 1\NBATTING DEAD 2\NTerror! King Crab Man's\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hExperiments
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:47.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,They're showing the \N{\i1}Batting Dead{\i0} zombie movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:50.19,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20\bord2\fnImpact\c&H2E08BA&\pos(70,228)}When the world's bases are loaded with the undead,\Nthe fate of humanity depends on one man's batting skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:50.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's one of my favorite series!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:53.73,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, sounds like fun! Let's go watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:55.56,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:56.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Is that okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:10:00.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That means going to the movie theater, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.99,0:10:04.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh? You're not much of a moviegoer, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:06.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Do you prefer to watch at home instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.56,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Not exactly, but movie theaters were mostly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:18.98,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,places I went to assassinate targets \Nrather than watch movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:22.56,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I never saw much of the movies themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:26.91,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,R-Right, movie theaters are dark, \Nnot to mention loud, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.81,DefaultItalics,MAN1,0,0,0,,I've had enough! I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:35.19,DefaultItalics,MAIN CHARACTER,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:44.91,DefaultItalicsTop,ZOMBIE,0,0,0,,Give me brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:44.36,DefaultItalics,MAN1,0,0,0,,Don't get any closer! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:46.16,DefaultItalics,ZOMBIE,0,0,0,,Brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:57.09,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:05.51,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Zombies... are scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:07.82,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What about zombies scares you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:11.38,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I feel like you'd take them down \Nin a flash, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:13.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,W-Well, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:17.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Firstly, I can't stand the \Nstench of decaying corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:19.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Right off the bat, a non-normal answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:23.53,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Plus, they're already dead, \Nso I can't kill them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.82,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:30.04,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,To Ms. Yuki, her past is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:33.32,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What happened in her past \Nused to be normal life for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:36.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She just wants to be normal, \Nbut that's all she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:40.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Furthermore, I have no \Nexperience being a corpse, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:43.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,None of us do! It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:47.16,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You're an assassin, \Nand you're afraid of zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:49.18,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You sure are weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.19,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Look, look, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:02.32,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's whipped cream heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.72,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,More like, check out how big that thing is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sure you won't spoil your dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:08.51,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I can eat this with room to spare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.25,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Delish!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:14.20,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Do you want some, too, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.71,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, may I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:16.97,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:19.67,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.69,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.89,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:28.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Nope, nope, nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:29.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Not on your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:31.69,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Then it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:37.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:38.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:40.59,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Right? Isn't it good?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, it is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.14,Default,TATSU,0,0,0,,You're losing your edge, Naka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:49.03,Default,TATSU,0,0,0,,You're not living up to the expectations \Nof someone from the Hikage bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:52.14,Default,TATSU,0,0,0,,Be aware of your surroundings at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.40,Default,TATSU,0,0,0,,Never let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:56.79,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,My apologies, Big Brother Tatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:12:59.59,Default,TATSU,0,0,0,,Train your lower body at tonight's practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:03.59,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm honored to have your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:13.02,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Going shopping was so much fun! \NLet's go again sometime, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:14.14,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.44,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You, too, Ms. Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.95,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If you're going, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:21.95,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Next time, we'll leave Big Brother \Nbehind and have a girls' day out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:24.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, that works better for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:32.83,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,See you again, Ms. Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:34.21,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:37.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm going to walk Riko back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:38.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What do you want to do, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:41.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,In that case, I will head home \Nand begin preparations for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:44.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,All right. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:15:00.96,Signs,SCREENCAP {14:56},0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs8\pos(386,234.5)\c&H222333&\3c&H585363&}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.50,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You want me to play with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:31.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's slobber all over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:36.37,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,We were out all day today, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:39.02,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I didn't get to do the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:41.96,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Even if Master Hitoyoshi is not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:43.68,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I can at least do laundry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:49.92,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Agemochitaro, let's wash \Nthat toy and towel as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:52.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Come, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:54.55,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Ah! Agemochitaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:07.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thunder and lightning? \NI wonder if Ms. Yuki is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:13.61,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,The power went out...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:40.36,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Was that sound Agemochitaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:22.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:28.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You got startled and accidentally \Nsliced Mochita's towel to pieces, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:31.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My sincerest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:34.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Mochita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:38.95,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will repair your shedding towel later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:44.41,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, man. I don't know if you're going to \Nbe able to fix something that's this torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:48.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will fix it... with everything I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:53.34,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, all right. Then I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Mochita?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:01.62,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of which, \Nyou're wearing the maid outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:08.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Is it because... you didn't really \Nlike the clothes we bought?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:11.39,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:18.27,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was truly happy about the clothes \Nwe selected and bought together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:19.36,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:26.18,Flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,I'll be having you attend to me \Nfrom today onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:30.22,Flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,That is a present from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.92,0:18:35.91,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,This maid outfit is also a very important \Ngift, given to me by my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:42.91,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's the only link to him \NI still have after his passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:51.19,Flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,If you ever decide you want to stop killing, \Nthat's fine by me, Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.55,0:18:55.68,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Back then, I didn't understand \Nthe meaning behind those words,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:19:00.09,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,and I ended up serving him as an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:06.72,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But now... This maid outfit has given me \Nthe opportunity to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:11.51,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Even if this form of clothing is not \Nconsidered to be "normal"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:14.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I want to keep wearing this maid outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:17.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is it odd to think this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:20.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I don't think it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:21.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:26.68,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,She said it was weird that I'm afraid \Nof zombies even though I'm an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:30.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, right, Ms. Grace did say \Nsomething like that, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's not weird at all, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:39.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's not weird to wear the things \Nyou love when you want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:43.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,or to be afraid of things that frighten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:47.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It just so happened that for you, \Nit's maid outfits that you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:50.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,and zombies that frighten you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:56.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,More so, it's normal to have \Nthings we like and don't like,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:20:00.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,and it's also normal to want \Nto cherish those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:05.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,So, I think you should just aim for the \Nnorm that works for you, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:10.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,A norm that works for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:12.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yep, yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:19.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You gotta wait a little longer, Mochita.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:21.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,We have to make dinner first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:26.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What, you can't wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:29.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh? This towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:33.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's the one that was with you \Nwhen we took you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:36.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Maybe it has the scent of his \Nparents on it or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:40.11,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Agemochitaro's... family's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:42.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Um, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:43.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:49.14,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I tried my hand \Nat repairing the towel before dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:51.72,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, it's fine by me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.17,0:20:56.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I understand Agemochitaro's feelings, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:21:00.82,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,This bell is the only thing that links me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.27,0:21:03.05,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,to my long-lost younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:06.49,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, your long-lost younger sister, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.79,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The mere thought of losing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:12.79,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Younger sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:20.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait! Ms. Yuki, you have a younger sister?!
